One standout feature is seamless multitasking . Developers can switch between the Godot Editor's 2D panel view and fully immersive VR windows, allowing for real-time testing and adjustments while staying within the same environment. This reduces the development friction typically encountered when switching between a PC and a VR device for testing. Additionally, it supports external peripherals like keyboards and mice to enhance productivity, mimicking the desktop experience​(

