Meta’s partnership with Godot aims to establish a free, open-source alternative to more widely used engines like Unity and Unreal, but tailored for the Quest ecosystem. This move reflects Meta’s broader ambitions to turn the Quest into a spatial computer, one capable of handling app creation, development, and distribution all from within the headset itself​(

